From 18d699119b78e487aa6f9a967c474f8ddbdeaebb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik Rao <rsrao2@illinois.edu>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:46:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bucketed GVT: --gvt-wave-allreduce combines count waves
 across processes by recursive doubling; --gvt-trace records when PE 0's
 process combined and got each result

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
